{
  "id": "53",
  "title": "妖祥赋",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“妖祥赋”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "命理深微，子平可推；先要取其日干，次则详其月令。年时共表其吉凶，《妖祥》不忒于岁月，通参于成败，祸福无遗。或有不见之形，须当审究；更有分抽之绪，后学难知。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-af10fd151ab868c94610-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天清地浊，自然稟一气之生。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-b702caa9d4118f69d14a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行正贵，忌刑冲剋破之乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-b798ba09ea640f342599-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱支干，喜三合六合之地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-68b01c3d83922bfbfc58-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "寅申巳亥，乃财官印綬长生。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-a47f5a010d81c5a7e098-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辰戌丑未，係禄马印星奇库。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-dee1895c75ad813e5dd3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日贵时贵，大忌刑冲剋破。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-14821e836529661399e2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "拱禄拱贵，最怕填实刑冲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-94a1671706777dd8e683-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "观无合有合，逢凶不凶。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-e5a7412f7b8a7d6a07bc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官之于年，运到官乡不喜。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-89430fd229701ffd20a1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃冲合岁君，运临而祸至。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-f64ba84767641ee22c7c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辰戌魁罡，忌官星怕逢七杀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-2a12402f485ec0e71733-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金神日刃，喜七杀而忌刑冲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-62011260a724f4c1e7b1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时上偏官要制伏，弱身强官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-07432278889e64d4ec79-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "专杀莫逢鬼旺，亦要制伏为强；但看本有本无，遇而不遇，要稟中和。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-52363217311a912b4bd3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛亥多逢丑地，怕填实，不喜官星。（飞天禄马格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-bd428b7fa5e9d7e9b3f9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲子日再逢子时，嫌丑午，亦畏庚辛壬癸亥子。（子遥巳格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-9bfb5b8291c3d0590852-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄马飞天，离巽（巳）丙丁聚巳午。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-a21c8115ff19068187cc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "倒冲天禄，壬骑龙背，辰多冲戌官星。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-2cdb3ff65ae642687bcb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙用丙子，聚贵声名。（乙巳鼠贵格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-2e168a6d38a5a43dac09-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "嗟夫！财命有气，背禄而不贫；绝财命衰，纵建禄而不富。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-f032781402408e37a18a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "癸到艮（寅）山，怕庚辛忌逢戊土。（刑合格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-7e2e80e39e5b9ee00cc7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬逢丑地，忌戊己怕见庚金。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-7b37cc9c35914a56b254-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚遇申子辰，乃井栏叉，又谓之入局，忌丙丁，愁巳午。（井栏叉格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-8cb7213cbc015a16da42-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戊见申时，怕甲丙亦忌寅卯。（合禄格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-9fc6a36af2e1583caeba-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛金己土若遇，谓之『从格』，名为『秀气』；四柱火伤又无救，是灾迍邅。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-1a4c21d3b0c21da452da-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛日戊子时，忌子多怕日相冲。（六阴朝阳格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-1ccbe05acaf6664f000a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳水逢辰见戊己，灾临难避。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-d6adb85b2365cab11fa1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲见己时，偏财运喜财乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-182fa20a8e9b7f2092db-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丁日辛年号岁财，运逢戊贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-0671273ef81a95d95673-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙逢申位，忌见刑冲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-45689211f6a4cc303dee-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日时归禄，官逢有祸。（归禄格）",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-f8033de247b442f93d7e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "另有天冲地击、阴错阳差、贪合忘官、劫先财后，名难成贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-b5ef301aaa1fa429db5e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "贪合忘杀，身旺时福，福禄增加。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-d6a2416b040b07cc8bf0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官藏杀见，有制伏亦自辉煌。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-eac297b72ad439736942-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官见杀藏，身弱后终见波渣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-6f4c318c586451e4a420-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身弱喜逢旺运。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-3efe5304aabd1b29e142-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身强最爱杀乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-56ceac0b2935fbce9a03-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "将来者进，功成者退，富贵喜重犯者奇；宜通变而推，决无差误矣！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-98a827ffac10b322d2e3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "络绎赋》",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-eb09cb02b2b7ee561020-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "参天地之奥妙，测造化之幽微，别人生之贵贱，取法则于干支；决生死之吉凶，推得失之玄妙。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-b5fae99b042de7c7be27-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲乙之木，最喜春生。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-c7688412fd59e6ac5f8c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "壬癸之水，偏宜冬旺。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-eb57b5491c641232aea6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丙丁火而夏明。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-d4f108eae16bf1800963-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "庚辛金而秋锐。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-6c019e72df4fffd912cc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戊己两干之土，要旺四季之期。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-af2e1b104cf063f110f3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日乃自身，须究强弱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-6e731c83875352891b3a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "年为本主，宜细推详。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-7dea50ff8d20ed87ab42-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "年干父兮支母。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-380ecb1df5b5e80270d8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日干己兮支妻。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-cfced3be335077c77a39-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "月干兄兮支弟。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-a77e881e67a6486048d1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "时支女兮干儿。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-0525ba6ff65cc9348bb8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "后杀剋年，父母早丧。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-859fcd4d750d1d7f988d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "前杀剋后，子息必亏。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-f45b345ab882a53557fe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "马入妻宫，必得能家之妇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-ff4d14dd3218f4443a4d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀临子位，必招悖逆之儿。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-5232a61bd15a1920bf23-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄入妻宫，食妻之禄。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-02a5d1c09b4ec5aa70ea-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印临子位，受子之荣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-094c46768879ec927946-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "梟居子位，破祖之基。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-697e4141d6b5dde58753-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财官月旺，得父貲财。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-6752eb969aa8a9099d52-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "所忌，财伤禄薄。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-8c252c37e14753ed13ef-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "最嫌，鬼旺身衰。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-690219707ed65bc70445-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "原其，剋彼为财，生我为印。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-bad5e8c25c4612219591-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "食神暗见，人物丰肥。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-e9db95fd4a1d3eee1da3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "梟印重生，祖财漂荡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-a7be17d76a69d017f65d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "咸池财露，主淫奢。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-bdf7f60f52aca516ed24-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "凶杀合年，防自刃。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-ee0cbd8519c45d1894fc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "土剋水，而成腹脏之疾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-ec8ce05a05acd8ecf3a8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "火锻金，以患癆瘵之灾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-b260fad23df13819b04d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "桃花会禄，酒色亡身。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-e95786476fb0d4dadf36-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财旺身衰，因财丧命。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-a9a58d1769735a15c896-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "观乎，财生官者，用贿求官；财坏印者，贪财卸职。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-f2d3922b6855390982e3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财旺生官，自身荣显。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-b505703e6057af00f6a3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财生杀党，夭折童年。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-5d5202a90c060cd710e1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "独杀冲破，废閒人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-439b1911909b4acf3e74-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "诸杀逢刑，凶狠辈。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-168daaa0304f4283d450-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天干多兮，见干年须当夭折。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-36fbbd1588c4fb1ed3f4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "地支多兮，见支年必见凶灾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-623b9f081cecf4842b3e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财生官，官生印，印生身，富贵双全。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-3598777ef4053a2ba7ec-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "干党财，财党杀，杀攻身，凶穷两逼。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-be4e52cd9bf9823a8fb5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "酉寅刑害继伤婚。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-d1c4fb14b7d8c609469f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丑卯风雷多性急。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-fcee47671896853bf172-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀官混杂，乃技艺之流。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-6c259ad9b04fb93eac14-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财禄生马，为经商之客。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-e874b195b23608607033-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "马落空亡，迁居飘流。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-a38317e8c2031a434bc8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄遭冲破，别土离乡。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-276a787dc9b0e8409b5e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阴多利于女人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-f4fc978f3bc5703bb48c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳盛宜于男子。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-646ab55024e7632f5cd9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阴盛于阳，主女兴家。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-bf8ef459d529d4f7ad5b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳胜于阴，男当建府。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-753cf490c16273426b6d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "纯阳，则男必孤寒。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-161d2bbc6f6130d123c9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "纯阴，则女当寡困。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-1f55fd4db341400479c3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官贵生年，伏凶煞而名垂万古。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-5319af2da76fb74b07a6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "贵宜乎多。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-a4cac7ee6e1f200888ca-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄宜乎少。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-86fbbae4aa1151e86c29-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "绝虑忘思，无差无误！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "53-cc60efc9d338b54d46b9-0",
      "translation": null
    }
